    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Now with hats!&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world's greatest Forest MMO! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill your deepest desires of becoming part of a forest! Come along, bring a wood-y friend or two, and join us! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand</strong> very still! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look</strong> at the beautiful (low poly) scenery! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MMOF</strong> (Massive Multiplayer Online Forest)! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TaaS</strong> (Trees as a Service)! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wear</strong> a hat (or not, this is <i>your simulation</i>)! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BECOME</i></strong> a tree (in a simulation)! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Join</i></strong> a growing (forest) community! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link to Discord is on the right-hand side!</p></li></ul></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will there be <strong><i>Rock DLC???</i></strong> (maybe)! </p></li></ul>",
